      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AWAYGOESTHEBUNNY (3) can be forgiven for one poor run on the Poly last time when a beaten favourite. His form prior reads strongly and expecting the rise in trip to suit him perfectly now under the lightweight of McColm's claim. CHAYSE 'N' ARTIE (1) deserves respect after a brave third at this track on soft ground, beaten a length and a half in BM70 company. Is right at home at this distance and the 3kg claim helps him carry the topweight more comfortably. THINKHARDANDFAST (2) has been plain at her last two, yet she has won around this trip and her overall record says she is capable of better. LA ROSETTA (4) has to rebound from a poor performance here last time when well below her best. Her Sunshine Coast BM70 win two back and a previous win around 1800m give her a genuine platform for improvement. OUT OF LUCK (5) is shooting for the hat-trick on the quick back-up and gets in light with the rise in grade. Not dismissing.",
